{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0283_1001_012mam", "source_sha256": "4f02a8e82eceff7c3f0b8721b6d69d0d3d2b1bca8d10ee0b4d6ad40e7dae9815", "ja": "兄ちゃん、兄ちゃん、兄ちゃん！！\n今日の真美、絶好調だったっしょ～！", "zh": "哥哥、哥哥、哥哥！！\n今天的真美状态超好吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0283_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c8ec55cc9dac467af08eaf56876f1086823ff20f825afdff6ad37acb28bc2d67", "ja": "ああ、すごく良かったぞ。『夢みたいな夜』\nってテーマにピッタリな、いい表情だった。", "zh": "啊，表现得非常好。那表情特别棒，和“宛如梦境的夜晚”这个主题非常契合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0283_1003_012mam", "source_sha256": "18df4939c5a1ef5553dca61c3a1605fe1535e329014875b7cc4550896a8955d0", "ja": "でしょでしょ？　めーっちゃ伝わってきたっしょ！？\nだってパジャマで遊び放題だよ？　ホント夢みたい！", "zh": "对吧对吧？是不是特别有感觉！？\n毕竟可以穿着睡衣尽情玩嘛？真的就像做梦一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0283_1004_012mam", "source_sha256": "02c9f13e980c575b2bcdc5ed4ba2ce4222532fa0d33b384c754d1365731a9f89", "ja": "お菓子もいっぱいあって、ゴロゴロゲームしてるだけで\nいいって……はっ！　もしかして、ここはまだ夢の中？", "zh": "还有好多零食，只要窝着打游戏就行……啊！难道这里还在梦里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0283_1005_012mam", "source_sha256": "16b86153636301a0e7410258a74070a79ec8ecaa35589386b3956ca27f4c8af9", "ja": "それなら真美、ず～っとここで暮らしたい～。\n夢の世界の住人になるんだ！　住民票を移さなきゃ！", "zh": "那样的话，真美想一直住在这里～  \n要成为梦世界的居民！得把户籍迁过来才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0283_1006_p", "source_sha256": "4fda0eef5b2564bc3afe3b8965a79bd58b2682e2bf60e342d66ef8d17086e2f2", "ja": "いやいやいや。そうは言ってもな。\n学校とか仕事はどうするつもりなんだ？", "zh": "不不不，话虽这么说。\n学校和工作你打算怎么办啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0283_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "b49005949bd9780ec2be30bbddb775b75cc98fb16fa4b5184aff7f29d10bc03c", "ja": "そんなシオカライ話はなしなし。\n夢の世界なら、毎日遊び放題にきまってるっしょ！", "zh": "别说那么扫兴的话啦。既然是在梦的世界里，当然可以每天尽情玩个痛快啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0283_1008_p", "source_sha256": "f4aa3cbf43ac9d8b9c605b71df72902bedaa0f66379d3647eb17f62c44145171", "ja": "うーん、そうか……。でも夢の世界って、時間の概念も\nないから、つまり成長もしなくなるってことだよな？", "zh": "嗯——是吗……不过梦的世界里连时间的概念都没有，也就是说，也不会成长了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0283_1009_012mam", "source_sha256": "229330544021bbddcde149e97627c01b93cb18a931519b3c6517cc56f8e0ef25", "ja": "え？　ってことは……\n真美、ずーっと今の姿のまんまってことになんの？", "zh": "咦？　也就是说……真美就会一直保持现在的模样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0283_1010_012mam", "source_sha256": "c32c0dc811b5bbc494a712ab1bba096230063b1fd9f864bd5f37b5a990bf4b19", "ja": "真美のせくしーへろもんも、\n今のまんまテータイしちゃうってこと？", "zh": "连真美的性感荷尔蒙也要就这样停滞不前了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0283_1011_p", "source_sha256": "dfa60597d1bd18bc31a20d708559a97e1b5f87315042a338c08d6d9cccad0883", "ja": "ああ、残念だが、そういうことになるだろうな。", "zh": "啊，遗憾的是，应该就是这么回事了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0283_1013_012mam", "source_sha256": "0ac4b160521af1cbcd2318d16c9ac61ca86f1b043af081dce5011f08e3ace22f", "ja": "兄ちゃん。真美、夢の世界に引っ越すのは、\nやっぱりちょっとお預けにすることにするよ……。", "zh": "哥哥。真美还是决定，先暂时不搬去梦的世界了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0283_1014_p", "source_sha256": "93560a78a02b15dfb3fc073aab98b92bb245289036bdcdab4b4fbb5c0581b112", "ja": "おっ、そうか。\n現実世界に戻る気になってくれたんだな！", "zh": "哦，这样啊。你愿意回到现实世界了啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0283_1015_012mam", "source_sha256": "e7a8cb2363e0a790fe1b41470822897fefaac484755cb516904a9519c3b33ad9", "ja": "……こうして真美は、夢のような夢から覚め……。\n大人の階段をまた一歩、せくしーに昇るのであった。", "zh": "……就这样，真美从如梦似幻的梦中醒来……\n又性感地踏上了通往成年的阶梯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0283_1016_012mam", "source_sha256": "bc8664c7d62eb08ff1196bb9a30e72fc6f88a0aa242ae6050a6c9fb64958a285", "ja": "そんな真美の願いはひとつ。……またこーゆー\n楽しいお仕事、ばんばんとってきてね♪　兄ちゃん！", "zh": "真美的愿望只有一个。……以后也要多多接这种\n开心的工作哦♪ 哥哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0283_1017_p", "source_sha256": "65b5c7e8572eb75e3ecd339a3bbe8a43b24dae224adf6a5961a69a259a6dbc40", "ja": "ああ、任せてくれ！　\n夢のような未来に向かって、一緒に頑張ろうな、真美！", "zh": "啊，交给我吧！\n朝着梦一般的未来，一起努力吧，真美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
